# docskills

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Canonical skills: `.agents/skills/adr-orchestrator` and `.agents/skills/doc-keeper`.

- Before opening ADRs: read `docs/adr/000-index.md`.
- Live product: `docs/current/`. Do not rewrite `docs/adr/done/`.
- Do not read `docs/archive/` unless explicitly asked.
- North Star: do not block refactors for backwards compatibility; prefer a clean cut.
- Invoke `adr-orchestrator` for intake, portfolio, phases, validation, handoff, or closeout.
- Invoke `doc-keeper` on every closeout and before `git commit`.
- No commit or push without explicit user authorization.
